## Installation

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="bash"}
---
code: |
  pnpm add @talex-touch/tuffex
---
:::

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="typescript"}
---
code: |
  import { TxDeviceMockup } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup'
  import '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/style.css'
  import '@talex-touch/tuffex/base.css' // tokens + resets, once per app
---
:::

## Usage

`TxDeviceMockup` ships 75+ tree-shakeable phone, tablet, desktop, rounded/circular watch, and browser presets with an extruded 3D hardware chassis, Shots.so shadows and curated scene pairings, spring morph animations, and lazy client-side SVG/PNG/WebP export.

### Device Catalog & Spring Morph

Browse or search 75+ presets across six hardware families; switching devices or flipping portrait ↔ landscape smoothly morphs dimensions and silhouette (`animated` enabled by default).

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="DeviceMockupBasicDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { iphone17Pro } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/presets/ios'
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const orientation = ref<'portrait' | 'landscape'>('portrait')
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxDeviceMockup
      :device="iphone17Pro"
      :orientation="orientation"
      animated
      show-status-bar
      show-cutout
      fit="contain"
      :max-height="380"
    >
      <div class="my-app-preview">Live UI</div>
    </TxDeviceMockup>
  </template>
---
:::

