### Mockup Studio, Scenes & Export

Apply any of 8 curated Shots.so `scene` pairings in one click, customize 12 gradients, film grain, glare, and watermarks, and export standalone SVG / PNG / WebP assets asynchronously in the browser.

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="DeviceMockupStudioDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import type { TxDeviceMockupInstance } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup'
  import { downloadDeviceMockupBlob } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/export'
  import { macbookPro14 } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/presets/desktop'
  import { appstoreHeroScene } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/scenes'
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const mockupRef = ref<TxDeviceMockupInstance | null>(null)

  async function savePng() {
    const blob = await mockupRef.value?.exportImage({ format: 'png', scale: 2 })
    if (blob)
      downloadDeviceMockupBlob(blob, 'preview.png')
  }
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxDeviceMockup
      ref="mockupRef"
      :device="macbookPro14"
      :scene="appstoreHeroScene"
      stage-ratio="16:9"
      src="/screenshots/dashboard.png"
      watermark="tuff.tagzxia.com"
    />
  </template>
---
:::

### Tree-Shaking & Subpath Imports

The core entry `@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup` bundles only `iphone-17-pro` and `responsive`, with zero static imports of the full preset catalog, curated scenes, or export engine. Import only the single preset, family pack, or subpath your page needs.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="typescript"}
---
code: |
  // 1. Single-preset zero-bloat import (0 bytes of other presets, scenes, or export)
  import { TxDeviceMockup } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup'
  import { iphone17Pro } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/presets/ios'
  // <TxDeviceMockup :device="iphone17Pro" />

  // 2. Register one family for synchronous string-ID lookups
  import { registerDeviceMockupPresets } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup'
  import { IOS_DEVICE_PRESETS } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/presets/ios'
  registerDeviceMockupPresets(IOS_DEVICE_PRESETS)

  // 3. Optional curated scenes and client-side export subpaths
  import { DEVICE_MOCKUP_SCENES } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/scenes'
  import { downloadDeviceMockupBlob, renderDeviceMockupSvg } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/export'
---
:::

### Best Practices

- Import individual preset objects from `@talex-touch/tuffex/device-mockup/presets/<family>` and pass them to `:device` when showcasing fixed models so unused presets stay out of your bundle.
- Keep `fit="contain"` with an explicit container height or `max-height` so spring morphs across phones, foldables, watches, and monitors never trigger horizontal overflow.
- In 3D perspectives, pair the solid hardware chassis (`frame-style="default"`) with `shadow="grounded"` and `screen-glare` for realistic metallic wall depth and studio contact shadows.
- Inside the default slot, read `preset.safeArea.top` to reserve top padding beneath the mobile status bar and Dynamic Island / cutout.
- Pass same-origin URLs or Base64 Data URLs to `src` when using client-side SVG/PNG/WebP export so downloaded assets remain self-contained and taint-free.

## API Reference

### Props

| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `device` | `DeviceMockupPreset \| DeviceMockupPresetId \| string` | `'iphone-17-pro'` | Preset object or ID across 75+ models; unregistered string IDs lazy-load only their family chunk. |
| `orientation` | `'portrait' \| 'landscape'` | `'portrait'` | Screen orientation; swaps width and height with a tactile spring settle on orientable devices. |
| `scene` | `DeviceMockupSceneId \| DeviceMockupScene` | `—` | Curated Shots.so pairing supplying backdrop, frame, shadow, perspective, framing, and glare defaults; explicit props win. |
| `frameStyle` | `'default' \| 'glass-light' \| 'glass-dark' \| 'liquid-glass' \| 'inset' \| 'outline' \| 'border' \| 'frameless'` | `'default'` | Shell bezel material and visual style. |
| `finish` | `'obsidian' \| 'silver' \| 'titanium' \| 'graphite'` | `'obsidian'` | Hardware shell finish and extruded 3D side-wall material. |
| `bezelColor` | `string` | `—` | Custom CSS color overriding the shell bezel fill. |
| `bezelWidth` | `number` | `—` | Custom bezel thickness in px; overrides the preset default. |
| `radius` | `number` | `—` | Custom inner screen corner radius in px; outer corners stay concentric. |
| `width` | `number` | `—` | Custom logical viewport width in px, primarily for `responsive`. |
| `height` | `number` | `—` | Custom logical viewport height in px, primarily for `responsive`. |
| `fit` | `'contain' \| 'width' \| 'none'` | `'contain'` | Responsive scaling mode inside the host box. |
| `scale` | `number` | `—` | Explicit scale multiplier; overrides automatic fitting. |
| `maxWidth` | `number \| string` | `—` | Maximum rendered width of the mockup container. |
| `maxHeight` | `number \| string` | `—` | Maximum rendered height of the mockup container. |
| `perspective` | `'flat' \| 'tilt-left' \| 'tilt-right' \| 'isometric' \| 'floating' \| 'angled-low'` | `'flat'` | Preset true-3D camera angle. |
| `interactiveTilt` | `boolean` | `false` | Enables live pointer-driven 3D parallax tilt on hover. |
| `tiltMaxAngle` | `number` | `10` | Maximum pointer tilt angle in degrees. |
| `shadow` | `boolean \| 'none' \| 'soft' \| 'crisp' \| 'grounded' \| 'elevated' \| 'dramatic' \| 'ambient'` | `'elevated'` | Hardware drop/floor shadow preset; `false` maps to `'none'`. |
| `framing` | `'center' \| 'bleed-bottom' \| 'bleed-top' \| 'bleed-left' \| 'bleed-right' \| 'float'` | `'center'` | Stage composition alignment and edge-bleed framing mode. |
| `screenGlare` | `boolean` | `false` | Overlays a subtle diagonal studio glass reflection across the screen. |
| `animated` | `boolean` | `true` | Enables spring morph transitions on device, orientation, scene, frame, finish, or framing changes (off under reduced motion). |
| `showShell` | `boolean` | `true` | Draws the hardware bezel, buttons, and stand geometry. |
| `showCutout` | `boolean` | `true` | Draws the Dynamic Island, notch, pill, camera punch, or lid notch. |
| `showStatusBar` | `boolean` | `true` | Displays the mobile or watch status bar chrome. |
| `statusBarTheme` | `'auto' \| 'light' \| 'dark'` | `'auto'` | Ink contrast mode for the status bar. |
| `statusBarTime` | `string` | `'9:41'` | Clock label rendered inside the status bar. |
| `showHomeIndicator` | `boolean` | `true` | Displays the bottom home indicator bar on modern phones and tablets. |
| `showHardwareButtons` | `boolean` | `true` | Draws side power, volume, or Digital Crown hardware buttons. |
| `browserUrl` | `string` | `'https://tuff.tagzxia.com'` | Address bar URL for browser presets. |
| `browserTitle` | `string` | `''` | Window title for browser and desktop window presets. |
| `browserTheme` | `'auto' \| 'light' \| 'dark'` | `'auto'` | Browser and desktop window toolbar chrome theme. |
| `backdrop` | `'none' \| 'solid' \| 'gradient' \| 'mesh' \| 'studio' \| 'obsidian' \| 'slate' \| 'transparent'` | `'none'` | Outer studio stage background mode. |
| `gradientPreset` | `'aurora' \| 'sunset' \| 'ocean' \| 'graphite' \| 'emerald' \| 'lavender' \| 'peach' \| 'midnight' \| 'sand' \| 'cobalt' \| 'rose' \| 'silver-mist'` | `'aurora'` | One of 12 built-in palettes used by `gradient` and `mesh` backdrops. |
| `backdropValue` | `string` | `—` | Custom CSS color or background value for the stage. |
| `backdropNoise` | `boolean` | `false` | Adds a fine film-grain texture over stage backdrops. |
| `stageRatio` | `'auto' \| '16:9' \| '4:3' \| '1:1' \| '9:16'` | `'auto'` | Aspect ratio locked onto the outer stage. |
| `stagePadding` | `number` | `32` | Padding around the hardware frame inside the stage in px. |
| `src` | `string` | `—` | Screenshot URL or Data URL; renders as an underlay when paired with the default slot. |
| `alt` | `string` | `''` | Alternative text for the screenshot and figure semantics. |
| `objectFit` | `'cover' \| 'contain' \| 'fill'` | `'cover'` | Object-fit mode applied to the `src` image. |
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Optional caption title rendered below the mockup. |
| `watermark` | `string` | `—` | Corner watermark string rendered on the stage and exported assets. |
| `labels` | `Partial<DeviceMockupLabels>` | English defaults | Localized accessibility label map. |

### Events

| Event | Payload | Description |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `metrics-change` | `(metrics: DeviceMockupMetrics)` | Fires whenever preset, orientation, or host resize recalculates viewport dimensions and scale. |

### Slots

| Slot | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `default` | `{ preset, width, height, orientation, scale }` | Live screen content rendered inside the viewport; layers above `src` when both are provided. |
| `status-bar` | `—` | Replaces the default mobile status bar chrome. |
| `browser-bar` | `—` | Replaces the default browser or window toolbar and URL bar. |
| `caption` | `—` | Replaces the default `title` caption node below the frame. |
| `watermark` | `—` | Replaces the default stage corner `watermark` node. |
| `overlay` | `—` | Layer rendered above the screen viewport for annotations or custom glares. |

### Exposed Methods

| Name | Signature | Description |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| `getMetrics` | `() => DeviceMockupMetrics` | Returns current logical viewport size, outer shell bounds, radii, bezel width, and active fit scale. |
| `exportSvg` | `(options?: DeviceMockupExportOptions) => Promise<string>` | Lazy-loads the export engine and serializes the current frame, backdrop, and media into a standalone XML-safe SVG string. |
| `exportImage` | `(options?: DeviceMockupExportOptions) => Promise<Blob \| null>` | Lazy-loads the export engine and rasterizes the mockup into a `png`, `webp`, or `svg` `Blob` at 1x, 2x, or 3x scale. |

