## Use cases

- Product landing pages and App Store hero graphics pairing real interactive UI with extruded 3D frames, bleed framing, and curated studio backdrops.
- Cross-device responsive inspectors morphing smoothly across 75+ iOS, Android, foldable, tablet, desktop, circular watch, and browser viewports.
- Browser-based mockup studios exporting self-contained 1x–3x PNG, WebP, or vector SVG assets locally.

